<span id="S5.T4.5.1.1.1.1.1.1.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_colspan ltx_colspan_2">Values represent the proportion of total explained variance (R<sup id="S5.T4.5.1.1.1.1.1.1.12.1.1" class="ltx_sup">2</sup> = 0.154) attributable to each predictor</span></span>
