<section id="A5.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.4 </span>Correlations between LLM hacking and F1 score by task</h3>

<figure id="A5.T10" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A5.T10.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 10</span>: </span><span id="A5.T10.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Point-biserial correlations between LLM hacking occurrence and model F1 score weighted across different tasks. Significance levels: * p &lt; 0.05, ** p &lt; 0.01, *** p &lt; 0.001.</span></figcaption>
<table id="A5.T10.5" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A5.T10.5.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A5.T10.5.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt">Task</th>
<th id="A5.T10.5.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">Correlation</th>
