<span id="A5.T11.7.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.T11.7.3.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">News articles</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A5.T11.7.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A5.T11.7.3.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:148.0pt;--ltx-bg-color:#ECECEC;">
<span id="A5.T11.7.3.4.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.T11.7.3.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">A set of articles from media sources covering the United States of America. Data was scraped from </span><a href="https://www.allsides.com/" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:50%;">https://www.allsides.com/</a><span id="A5.T11.7.3.4.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">.</span></span>
