<p id="A6.I3.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I3.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Dataset notes:</span> Following <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citet"><a href="#bib.bib38" title="" class="ltx_ref">Gligoric et al. [38]</a></cite>, we consider perceived politeness as a binary classification task and omit the neutral class. This reduces the number of datapoints from 6594 to 3298.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
