<p id="A6.I8.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I8.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Task description:</span> Labelling news articles according to Left, Right, and Centrist political bias. This task provides an entire news article as context.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A6.I8.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
