</div></li>
<li id="A6.I9.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A6.I9.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.I9.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I9.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Dataset Links:</span> <a href="https://github.com/KaiDMML/FakeNewsNet" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://github.com/KaiDMML/FakeNewsNet</a>, <a href="https://github.com/jiayingwu19/SheepDog" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://github.com/jiayingwu19/SheepDog</a></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A6.I9.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A6.I9.i4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
