</div></li>
<li id="A6.I9.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A6.I9.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.I9.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I9.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Dataset notes:</span> The dataset was originally released by <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citet"><a href="#bib.bib106" title="" class="ltx_ref">Shu et al. [106]</a></cite> with ground truth annotations and metadata. <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citet"><a href="#bib.bib131" title="" class="ltx_ref">Wu et al. [131]</a></cite> subsequently provided the news article contents.</p>
