<div id="A6.I37.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.I37.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I37.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Task description:</span> Classifying the tone of a political ad as positive, neutral, or negative.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A6.I37.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A6.I37.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
