</span>  manifestos_uk dataset</h3>

<div id="A6.SS16.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<ul id="A6.I38" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A6.I38.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A6.I38.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.I38.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I38.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Data Type:</span> Party Manifestos from the UK</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A6.I38.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A6.I38.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.I38.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I38.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Dataset description:</span> Sentences from manifestos from UK parties, 1987 to 2010.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A6.I38.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
